{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>韓國農心為慶祝辛辣麵上市40週年，在首爾聖水洞開設大型快閃體驗店「辛辣麵粉食 THE FACTORY」。\n</p>\n<p>最受歡迎的自製杯麵體驗只需4,000韓圜（折合約HK$20），大家可自選辛辣麵或浣熊麵杯身與粗幼麵條，12款配料中更能任揀5款，招牌浣熊造型魚糕與炒蛋通通加到滿！封蓋後掃描杯身QR Code，上傳手機相片就能即場印出專屬貼紙貼在杯蓋上，自製世上唯一的限定包裝。</p>\n<p>除了自製杯麵，場內亦有周邊商品區，可親手DIY辛辣麵刺繡燙章的帆布袋與帽子，門外更設有巨型杯麵等打卡位。</p>\n<p>辛辣麵粉食 THE FACTORY<br/>\n📍地址：首爾特別市城東區聖水一路4街52<br/>\n📅快閃日期：即日起至11月下旬<br/>\n🚇交通：首爾地鐵2號線「聖水站」4號出口步行約4分鐘\n</p>\n<p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令你念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179310973854225379_14812549056ae0aeec7d98e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179310973854225379_14812549056ae0aeec7d98e.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@yonnielee)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/De_6lPQvdM8/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%81%96%e6%b0%b4%e6%b4%9e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">聖水洞</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%be%9b%e8%be%a3%e9%ba%b5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">辛辣麵</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%9f%93%e5%9c%8b%e5%bf%ab%e9%96%83%e5%ba%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">韓國快閃店</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@yonnielee資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/De_6lPQvdM8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nOct 27 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:21:38.708776+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":549,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T14:02:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:37.492053+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:45.380467+00:00","content_hash":"e476a5f9223ab67773d9088ec1ab4d34ed24bec6c7c48bdfcad9c96e993a9379","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}